</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </REF_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <REF_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a645" ANNOTATION_REF="a294">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>So, he found out about them, and then he went back home.


</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </REF_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <REF_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a646" ANNOTATION_REF="a295">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>So, he started to look for a weapon, thinking he was going to kill his uncles.
</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </REF_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <REF_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a647" ANNOTATION_REF="a296">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>That is where he was from before he came to the place they fled to, where his mother fled with him.
</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </REF_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <REF_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a648" ANNOTATION_REF="a297">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>It had been really forbidden, and he already knew what had happened.
</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </REF_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <REF_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a649" ANNOTATION_REF="a298">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>So, he cut down some wood that was pole-like to make a club with.


</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </REF_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <REF_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a650" ANNOTATION_REF="a299">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>And he was testing it on the rock.
