            </REF_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <REF_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a665" ANNOTATION_REF="a314">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>While he was flying, they were just running.


